# Ruleset: Brokerages
#
# Expects a proxy policy.
#
# Futu and Longbridge are Hong Kong brokerages that refuse logins from a mainland address. Their apps can answer from mainland addresses and reach the direct path through GEOIP,CN unless matched by name. A brokerage ties a session to the address it sees, as a bank does, so each takes one path by name. Must precede GEOIP,CN. Mainland brokerages stay on the mainland path; GF Securities is in Platforms/China.list.

# Futu
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,futunn.com

# Longbridge
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lbctrl.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lbkrs.com
